Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,=======TEXT=======
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}其实 我有个小礼物要送给你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}诶 什么什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.49,0:00:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}当心脚下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.29,0:00:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.47,0:00:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.41,0:01:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我记得是在这…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.62,0:01:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}欢迎来到我自己的秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.35,0:01:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遥乃的秘密基地…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.63,0:01:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.68,0:01:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在灯塔底下？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.17,0:01:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}正所谓灯下黑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.21,0:01:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}开个玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.95,0:03:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}灯塔的底下竟然有地下室…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.31,0:03:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就像拍电影一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.66,0:03:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}听说这里是偷偷改建的空间哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.86,0:03:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好意思哈 还要让你们来帮忙打扫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没事儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.67,0:03:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}秘密基地 秘密基地！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.17,0:03:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个 宝 宝木同学你 为什么有 地下室的钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不愧是海果 让你发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.36,0:03:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不愧是海果 真机灵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.57,0:03:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}其实 我的爷爷以前是这座灯塔的管理员
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}自从这座灯塔废弃以后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.20,0:03:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}爷爷他就把这个地下室拿来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:04:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}当我们在一起玩的秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.66,0:04:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}后来 钥匙丢了 最近也就没怎么来过了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.66,0:04:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那么 从今天开始 我们就来这一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.11,0:04:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 畅快玩吧 幽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}给 钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}给我？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因为听到幽在灯塔住着以后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.82,0:04:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就很一直很担心你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.71,0:04:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以这个房间就交给你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.16,0:04:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遥 遥 遥 遥乃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.26,0:04:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这样 这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.48,0:04:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}以后就把这里当做我们一起的秘密基地吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.29,0:04:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}三个人的…秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.01,0:04:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}本来就是遥乃你的基地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我怎么能独吞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.31,0:04:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}诶？但 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.97,0:04:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你在这地方有很多回忆吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遥乃能经常来一起玩的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.85,0:04:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我觉得也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.67,0:04:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}确实呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.55,0:04:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.47,0:05:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}打倒瞬大作战
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.89,0:05:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}第一次作战会议
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.45,0:05:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明天就是星期六了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.10,0:05:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}先抓紧去买东西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}买东西？要出去玩了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 最近材料有点缺了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.65,0:05:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 嗯… 绝 绝缘胶带
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快没有了 要补充一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}再 再要一些硬塑料板当机翼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.77,0:05:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}珍珠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我想尝尝珍珠奶茶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.73,0:05:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}「珍珠奶茶」…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊啦 珍珠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.45,0:05:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那么 明天早上十点碰面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要出去玩咯 好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.69,0:05:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}姐姐的头发太硬了 必须要再收拾一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.50,0:05:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}穗 穗波 谢谢你帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.05,0:05:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}姐姐确实很少让人帮忙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.25,0:05:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要去哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.85,0:06:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}去 去街上买东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.23,0:06:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Bonavuu！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.19,0:06:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}M-Mativuu 宝木
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.11,0:06:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还有十五分钟呢 你来得真早
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.83,0:06:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我也是才到的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.57,0:06:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Bonavuu！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}抱歉 我没迟到吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.92,0:06:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Mativuu
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.98,0:06:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没有没有 刚好到点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.21,0:06:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}M-Mativuu
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.03,0:06:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我也才到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.86,0:06:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}先去把小材料都买来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哇 全是塑料瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.49,0:07:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这些可以免费拿走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.09,0:07:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对 我已经向店长沟通过了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.93,0:07:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这下不用再让明内同学硬喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.41,0:07:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可 可是 这些
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.81,0:07:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}似乎没几个大小合适的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.39,0:07:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太小了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.41,0:07:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们 也要这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.94,0:08:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.94,0:08:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要几个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要…六个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.91,0:08:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}给
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.45,0:08:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}给
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.09,0:08:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谢谢 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.85,0:08:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}能碰到这么善良的人真好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.07,0:08:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这下就把所有东西都买齐了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.06,0:08:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}任务完成！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.78,0:08:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然后呢 然后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.91,0:08:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对啊 正好还有点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}开玩！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个就是大头贴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}闪闪发光的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.14,0:09:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我还是第一次拍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.45,0:09:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}话说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.95,0:09:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果都没有好好出镜呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.74,0:09:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我不怎么拍照
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那么 下次让海果站中间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我就算 算 算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.60,0:09:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.40,0:09:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}被抓的外星人？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.21,0:09:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还不是因为海果要跑嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}拍得有点奇怪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.49,0:09:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}再来一次吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.91,0:09:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.23,0:09:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这样挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.03,0:10:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这样就很好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}再拍一张
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.67,0:10:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}再拍一张嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.91,0:10:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}求求了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也想用春日限定风格pose拍照！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.27,0:10:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}幽看起来很想再拍一张
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.67,0:10:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}珍珠奶茶 好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}珍珠珍珠 奶茶奶茶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}珍珠奶茶~
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.32,0:10:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}珍珠珍珠 奶茶奶茶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.19,0:10:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.43,0:10:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还是头一次这样和别人一起出去玩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对了 要不去文具店里看看吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.03,0:10:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.17,0:10:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}下一次想要和雷门同学一起来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.22,0:10:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯？钢魃里欧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.33,0:10:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是机器人的动画呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.37,0:10:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小学的时候 在学校很流行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}中 中学的时候 听说雷门同学…好像很喜欢这个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.75,0:11:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}别偷听啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.34,0:11:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}诶 很帅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.53,0:11:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那 那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.74,0:11:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}火 火箭的设计…就用这个…怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.98,0:11:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.03,0:11:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我为什么要认真去做这种塑料火箭玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蠢死了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没有兴趣的事情 就没必要去做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.78,0:11:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对于她们来说也是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.46,0:11:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只不过 制作火箭就是需要我的技术
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.18,0:11:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对了 互相都没有兴趣的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.83,0:11:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这事就结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.38,0:11:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这样不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.13,0:11:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这样的比赛赶紧结束掉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:12:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}终于 激动人心的决胜时刻来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}塑料瓶火箭比赛开幕了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.23,0:12:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}流星队的海果队员
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.12,0:12:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你现在的感想是？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.60,0:12:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}流星队？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}刚刚想的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.85,0:12:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}请说说你的感想
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}必 必 必 必胜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.21,0:12:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}敌对的瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.74,0:12:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你的感想呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.93,0:12:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我可以回去了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.36,0:12:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还有 今天早上吃的什么呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.89,0:12:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喜欢往增味汤里加什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.51,0:12:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}听人话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.15,0:12:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喜欢吃面包还是米饭？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喜欢吃米饭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.14,0:12:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}别把我扯进你们的闹剧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快点开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.87,0:12:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}比赛前就是要这种热闹的感觉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那你十天前的早饭是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.82,0:12:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.57,0:12:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}十 十天前？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呃…嗯…
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.25,0:12:48.83,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}1…2…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.57,0:12:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}笨蛋电波
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.21,0:12:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}先说一下规则吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.71,0:12:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想不起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.49,0:12:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}两枚火箭决胜可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.33,0:12:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.59,0:13:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}双方各自发射两枚火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.43,0:13:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然后记录较好的一枚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.06,0:13:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}会被采用然后决胜么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.85,0:13:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.28,0:13:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}塑料瓶火箭飞得更远的就可以赢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.05,0:13:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呃…嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.18,0:13:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}先攻
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.24,0:13:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.01,0:13:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.87,0:13:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那我立起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.40,0:13:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.73,0:13:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他们的火箭…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.68,0:13:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}涂装和配色和钢魃里欧马克3号的胸部装甲有点…像
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.59,0:13:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不 肯定是偶然 偶然！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}3 2 1
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.91,0:14:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}103米
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.74,0:14:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好诶 超过100米了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最高 记录
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.94,0:14:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这样的话应该能赢雷门同学了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.30,0:14:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们的 我们一起做的火箭一定可以
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}肯定没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.03,0:14:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}请飞得再远一些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.12,0:14:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}为了将这份想法传达给雷门同学
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.82,0:15:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}第2枚超过了110米
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.31,0:15:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}风向也是逆风的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.77,0:15:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}精确设计的机身…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.93,0:15:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}水压和气压
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.28,0:15:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他们确实做得很极致了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在测试里我得出的最好成绩是107米
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.06,0:15:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}刚才的成绩也已经是非常好的了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果只靠手压泵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.79,0:15:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想赢的话恐怕会很困难
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.86,0:15:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他们的马克Ⅲ 干得不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.55,0:15:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}乖~乖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.99,0:15:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.67,0:15:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}别以为这样就赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.44,0:15:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我可是还有一枚火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们的成绩 我轻轻松松就可以超越
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.63,0:15:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就用它！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.84,0:15:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.59,0:15:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}诶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.79,0:15:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好像和我知道的塑料瓶火箭不太一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:15:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.85,0:15:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}塑料瓶火箭？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.87,0:16:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.02,0:16:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们做的不就是水压火箭吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.21,0:16:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也没有不能把动力源换成火药这种规则吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}给我飞到更高的地方吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.16,0:16:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}超过他们！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}飞行高度为127米
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.73,0:16:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好厉害…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不对 你耍赖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.73,0:16:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是耍赖 犯规的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.24,0:16:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哪里耍赖了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我外壳用的是塑料瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.80,0:16:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就算用的动力是火药的模型火箭也没违反规则
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.05,0:16:51.67,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们3对1 那才是犯规吧
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.68,0:16:53.66,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且都还没有测距离
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.72,0:16:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}输了 输掉了
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.79,0:16:55.54,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}分明就是耍赖
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.10,0:16:57.94,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}高度也算是距离啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.66,0:16:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明明这是最后一次和雷门同学说话的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}搞什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.93,0:17:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只是输了这种比赛就一副世界完了的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.64,0:17:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}搞得我好像才是坏人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喂 好歹我给你看了这些好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}别给我低沉着脸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.29,0:17:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是气不打一处来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}说吧 你想说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.93,0:17:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}败犬的嚎叫 我还是会听听的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可 可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.73,0:17:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 可以
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.01,0:17:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}随便你说就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.38,0:17:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}反正也是「帮我做火箭 给我需要的部件」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.57,0:17:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}之类的自以为是的话呗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.82,0:17:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还故意绕这么远的路
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.07,0:17:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}结果还是输了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.78,0:17:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雷 雷门同学
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.26,0:17:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最后被可怜 才能有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.19,0:17:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.51,0:17:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就让我把这种愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.97,0:17:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}彻底断绝了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你 你头上的 那个护目镜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好酷！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蛤？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}从初 初中的时候我就这么觉得了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一直
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}很想这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.03,0:18:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雷门同学的护目镜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.75,0:18:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好好好 好酷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.03,0:18:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蛤？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.70,0:18:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我也想戴了看看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.30,0:18:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蛤？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.25,0:18:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}难道你想直接对我说的就是这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.03,0:18:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.29,0:18:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因为雷门同学从那以后就没来学校了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.46,0:18:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就没 没有可以说的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.83,0:18:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以 所以就
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个 我如果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.41,0:18:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还 还能在 学 学校见到雷门同学的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.03,0:18:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今 今天的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.94,0:19:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虽 虽然很不甘心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.23,0:19:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.15,0:19:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有机会 再一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.89,0:19:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.67,0:19:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}去买饮料…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.55,0:19:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊啦 海果？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.91,0:19:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还真是海果的风格
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.07,0:19:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯…但总感觉好像忘了最初的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.95,0:19:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过 好像也不重要了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.94,0:19:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬 我们也玩的很高兴哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.49,0:19:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以下次再一起哦 瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.05,0:19:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}下次就在学校吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果  我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.40,0:19:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哦呃 还有遥乃的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.45,0:19:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们两个 自动贩卖机在另外一边啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.63,0:19:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}搞什么呀 这些家伙到底搞什么鬼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.15,0:19:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊啊 真是无聊的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.39,0:20:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的 好无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.92,0:20:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}检查鞋柜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.97,0:20:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不知道瞬来了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.43,0:20:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没事的 去教室吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.57,0:20:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.52,0:20:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Bonavuu~
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.05,0:20:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好吵
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.96,0:20:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雷 雷门同学
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.67,0:20:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可别搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.51,0:20:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我只是因为出勤时间不太够 所以才来的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.47,0:20:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鞋子都没换呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.32,0:20:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不换鞋是不行的
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.75,0:20:56.74,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}已经抹布擦干净了 所以没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.31,0:20:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}室内鞋我忘带了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.95,0:21:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.16,0:21:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}别一直盯着我看了行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.66,0:21:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}光凭你们想要造去宇宙的火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.03,0:21:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}估计一辈子都不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.22,0:21:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}拉胯得让我很不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.87,0:21:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以 稍微一点的话 我也不是不能帮你们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.71,0:21:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在赚出勤时间的顺便
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.82,0:21:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.10,0:21:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.32,0:23:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}幽 幽
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.27,0:23:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可以和我也来一下额门感应吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.30,0:23:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}OK
